0..73 Comment "// A source\'s own constructor named like one of `Theory`\'s keeps its name"
74..142 Comment "// beside a `theory` block. The block\'s code is minted all the same,"
143..220 Comment "// and each constructor of `Theory` the source does not name reads as it does"
221..300 Comment "// anywhere: `App` is declared before the block, `Sort` after it, and a generic"
301..359 Comment "// program still reads the block by `Oper` and `Presents`."
360..362 Comment "//"
363..378 Comment "// - see: #2348"
